{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52495","headline":"流所赠张锡 · 魏玄同","name":"流所赠张锡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄叶因风下，甘从洛浦隈。\n白云何所爲，还出帝乡来。\n（见《十万卷楼丛书》本皎然《诗式》卷三）（按：此诗作者原署作「韦玄同」。\n张锡，《旧唐书》卷八五有传附其叔张文瓘传後，则天时爲相，约卒於睿宗时。\n检初唐史传，无韦玄同其人。\n魏玄同曾配流岭外，与张锡恰同时，「韦」、「魏」读音又极相近，因知此诗应爲魏玄同作，作韦玄同爲音近而误。\n《全唐诗》卷九九误作章玄同诗，今移正。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏玄同","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}